      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I think we should `panic` if the deps file does not exist. We should only attempt to access the deps file if tools/bazel succeeded in running (otherwise soong_build should have already exited!), and tools/bazel should always generate a deps file during successful execution.\n\nI also worry that printf is masking an error and causing presubmits to superfluously pass, even if the deps file couldn\u0027t be found. A panic would ensure that that\u0027s not the case 😊",
      "revId": "a35e8a0730f7e33f023a7deafa3ec5918e6ad89d",
